{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"zhuge-e-o022a","title":"诸葛亮封武乡侯开府领益州牧","accounts":[{"id":"zhuge-e-o022a-account","label":"《诸葛亮传第五》正文","text":"诸葛亮封武乡侯开府领益州牧","evidence":["zhuge-e-o022a-q"]}],"participants":[{"person":"zhuge-liang","role":"受任","evidence":["zhuge-e-o022a-q"]}],"place":null,"time":{"year":223,"label":"建兴元年","precision":"year","basis":"逐条核对本篇纪年及所引释年；未换算公历日。","chronology":"zhuge-y223","dating_review":{"reviewed":true,"anchor":"zhuge-q-o021","basis":"建兴元年"},"evidence":["zhuge-e-o022a-q","zhuge-q-o021","wendi-q-o038","wendi-q-b-94d58550e3abb558ad13"]},"ordering_evidence":"zhuge-e-o022a-q","source_order":[35,133,"O022a"],"order":6780}],"persons":[{"id":"zhuge-liang","name":"诸葛亮","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"wendi-q-b-94d58550e3abb558ad13","section":"chapter-002","block":"b-94d58550e3abb558ad13","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗四年：黄初四年（公元 223）。","section_title":"文帝纪第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0009.xhtml","index":394,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-2950ca88709b8c25fb44","start":0,"end":19},{"id":"wendi-q-o038","section":"chapter-002","block":"b-62c39b4b73d5f8874468","layer":"original","quote":"四年春正月〖1〗，诏曰：“丧乱以来，兵革未戢〖2〗。天下之人，互相残杀。今海内初定，敢有私复仇者，皆族之〖3〗！”筑南巡台于宛。","section_title":"文帝纪第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0009.xhtml","index":391,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":64},{"id":"zhuge-e-o022a-q","section":"chapter-035","block":"b-cdc51ff4fdbd6022c499","layer":"original","quote":"建兴元年，封亮武乡侯〖6〗；开府治事〖7〗。顷之，又领益州牧；政事无巨细，咸决于亮。","section_title":"诸葛亮传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0076.xhtml","index":132,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":42},{"id":"zhuge-q-o021","section":"chapter-035","block":"b-6f9ad1f5d575a9d3f55f","layer":"original","quote":"章武三年春，先主于永安病笃〖1〗；召亮于成都，属以后事。谓亮曰：“君才十倍曹丕，必能安国，终定大事。若嗣子可辅，辅之；如其不才〖2〗，君可自取〖3〗。”亮涕泣曰：“臣敢竭股肱之力〖4〗，效忠贞之节，继之以死！”先主又为诏敕后主曰：“汝与丞相从事〖5〗，事之如父。”﹝一﹞","section_title":"诸葛亮传第五","source":{